  m_text: '<i>"Beacons of hope must be lit to guide those caravans still lost along
    the way."</i>


    Each Beacon Tier will grant a bonus of 5 <b>Hope</b> whenever
    a caravan begins traveling through a new region.


    Additionally, each Tier
    will provide a <b>+3%</b> Exploration chance for future caravans.'
