  m_text: '<i>"Only through efficient joint organization will we be able to overcome
    this situation."</i>


    Each Tier upgrade grants 2 <b>Rescue Mission</b>,
    which can be used by future caravans as emergency support.


    Additionally,
    each Tier reduces by <b>10%</b> the prices of Trade Posts encountered on the
    road by future caravans.'
