      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>-----Active Exploration</b>\n\nActive Exploration is used to reveal
    the type of a <b>Mysterious Node</b> adjacent to the Caravan\u2019s position.\n\nIt
    is activated with the <b>Right Mouse Button</b>, and will cost 5 Civilians.\n\nThe
    Black Breath will advance by one position and, unless the attempt fails, the
    Type of the selected Node will be revealed and the Civilians will return.\n\nIf
    it fails, the Civilians will be lost."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
